  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICSP Programme, implemented by Tr&#xf3;caire in the West Bank Area of Occupied Palestinian Territories-Israel, contributes to outcome 1.1. Duty-bearers have taken actions to respect and protect rights. The objective is that alliances of civic actors engage with duty-bearers to promote the respect and protection of rights. The programme is in partnership with B&apos;Tselem, Breaking the Silence, Al Haq, and Who Profits.    ----   The principal focus of this outcome is:- Advocacy for the protection of human rights- Work under this outcome has a specific focus on women and women human rights defenders</narrative>
